{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23241","headline":"初到郡斋寄钱湖州李苏州 · 白居易","name":"初到郡斋寄钱湖州李苏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俱来沧海郡，半作白头翁。\n谩道风烟接，何曾笑语同。\n吏稀秋税毕，客散晚庭空。\n霁後当楼月，潮来满座风。\n霅溪殊冷僻，茂苑太繁雄。\n唯此钱唐郡，闲忙恰得中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}